    },
    {
      "text": "City of Campbell notice (2021-02-26): application of Akbar Abdollahi for a Planned Development Permit (PLN-2018-225) for nine single-family residences, a new private street and site and landscaping improvements; a Tentative Subdivision Map for nine single-family lots and one common lot; a Parking Modification Permit to reduce required parking; a Tree Removal Permit for one fruitless mulberry; and a Variance to retain overhead utility lines and/or place new poles, at 202 W. Rincon Avenue. Staff recommended a CEQA categorical exemption.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report Table A2 lists 202 W Rincon Ave (APN 305-33-007, tracking PLN2018-00225): 9 for-sale above-moderate units, entitled 2021-07-23, building permits 2022-08-22. Individual house permits on APN 305-33-007: 182 W Rincon (BLD-2022-1625, permit 2024-09-04, occupancy 2025-10-17); 184 W Rincon (BLD-2022-1626, permit 2024-06-24, occupancy 2025-08-20); 186, 188 and 200 W Rincon (BLD-2022-1627, -1628, -1630, permits 2024-06-21, occupancy 2025-08-20).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001143",
        "SRC-001134"
      ]
